{"id":"n31513-1-7","stage":5,"title":"걸핏하면 · 动不动就","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31513-1-7-1","ko":"너는 요즘 왜 걸핏하면 화를 내고 그래?","zh":"你最近怎么动不动就发脾气啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"걸핏하면","meaning":"动不动就","explanation":"걸핏하면：动不动就。","readings":[{"term":"걸핏하면","audio":"/audio/5014ca13da8806bf0754.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31513","senseId":"1","lemma":"걸핏하면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸핏하면","audio":"/audio/5014ca13da8806bf0754.mp3"}},{"text":"화를","meaning":"火，气","explanation":"화：火，气；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"화","audio":"/audio/950afe85bf406364ecdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74134","senseId":"1","lemma":"화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화를","audio":"/audio/796488caaf79e93bb6ec.mp3"}},{"text":"내고","meaning":"发脾气、表现出不满（화를 내다）","explanation":"내다：发脾气、表现出不满（화를 내다）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"내다","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89906","senseId":"13","lemma":"내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내고","audio":"/audio/cb239a95e6ec9043818d.mp3"}},{"text":"그래?","meaning":"那样，一般","explanation":"그렇다：那样，一般；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"5","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"5014ca13da8806bf","term":"걸핏하면","zh":"动不动就","audio":"/audio/5014ca13da8806bf0754.mp3","entryId":"31513","definition":"只要稍微一有什么事情就马上。","pronunciation":["걸피타면"]},{"id":"950afe85bf406364","term":"화","zh":"火，气","audio":"/audio/950afe85bf406364ecdd.mp3","entryId":"74134","definition":"十分不满意或恼怒的情绪。","pronunciation":["화ː"]},{"id":"3c7ab23f77767092","term":"내다","zh":"发脾气、表现出不满（화를 내다）","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3","entryId":"89906","definition":"发脾气、表现出不满（화를 내다）","pronunciation":["내ː다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样，一般","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"不好或不太满意。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/911898e31004bc88b0e0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31513-1-7-2","ko":"시험이 얼마 안 남아서 예민해졌나 봐.","zh":"考试快到了，所以才变得这么敏感吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시험이","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험이","audio":"/audio/3539bd8e76462c84a4b0.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少。","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"남아서","meaning":"剩，剩下","explanation":"남다：剩，剩下；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"1","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남아서","audio":"/audio/bccdeedc0f47035b105f.mp3"}},{"text":"예민해졌나","meaning":"敏感；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"예민하다：敏感；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"예민하다","audio":"/audio/07e96f3c93ffb0ed67f6.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68449","senseId":"3","lemma":"예민하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예민해졌나","audio":"/audio/5cef420f440ca163671f.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definiti